Consequently, a minimum reader cannot retain all reader laws after this replacement. If zero remains correct, **some unary length must fail**. Below 46, a first body redex has one to five additional syntactic uses; their collective dependence is proved, not individual productivity. See [NeededHead.lean](/Users/a9lim/Work/blam/tmp/round4/close46/NeededHead.lean:121).

For nested head redexes, pending operands can be moved beneath the inner binder with an exact capture charge. Independent nested definitions can then be interchanged without copying either definition. Including arbitrary pending operands, the checked cost change is

```text
F(A) − F(E) + uses_y(D) − uses_x(D) + G
